%SIXMD 1
# @?SUM - CALCULATE A 36-BIT WORD CHECKSUM

## DESCRIPTION

ADDS 36-BIT WORDS FROM FILE OR STANDARD INPUT AND PRINTS THE RESULT IN OCTAL.

USAGE IS 'SUM [FILE]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/SUM
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/SUM.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

